# Docker Image: kathara-pytorch

Download the `Dockerfile` to create the custom Docker image `kathara-pytorch`.
It is used to run Python scripts with PyTorch (CPU version) inside Kathara virtual devices without having to reinstall the libraries every time.

---

### What the image contains

* Official Kathara base image (`kathara/base`)
* Python 3 and Pip
* PyTorch and Torchvision (CPU version)

